    {"type":"text","id":"b3ht","x":52,"y":760,"width":1376,"height":28,"text":"LIVELLO 3 — SCALING THE HARNESS  ·  Multi-agent orchestration over code","originalText":"LIVELLO 3 — SCALING THE HARNESS  ·  Multi-agent orchestration over code","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#FFFFFF","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13005,"version":1,"versionNonce":13006,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"b3r1","x":52,"y":808,"width":320,"height":250,"strokeColor":"#DA702C","backgroundColor":"#FFFFFF","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13007,"version":1,"versionNonce":13008,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"b3r1t","x":60,"y":816,"width":304,"height":234,"text":"ROLE SPECIALIZATION\n\nplanner — decompone obiettivi\ncoder — genera codice\ntester — crea + esegue test\nreviewer — valuta qualità\nexecutor — runs deterministi\n\nNovelty in EvoMAC:\n+ Gradient Agent: attribuisce\n  fallimenti ad agenti specifici\n+ Updating Agent: revisiona\n  prompt + topologia DAG","originalText":"ROLE SPECIALIZATION\n\nplanner — decompone obiettivi\ncoder — genera codice\ntester — crea + esegue test\nreviewer — valuta qualità\nexecutor — runs deterministi\n\nNovelty in EvoMAC:\n+ Gradient Agent: attribuisce\n  fallimenti ad agenti specifici\n+ Updating Agent: revisiona\n  prompt + topologia DAG","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1B2631","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13009,"version":1,"versionNonce":13010,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"b3r2","x":390,"y":808,"width":300,"height":250,"strokeColor":"#DA702C","backgroundColor":"#FFFFFF","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13011,"version":1,"versionNonce":13012,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"b3r2t","x":398,"y":816,"width":284,"height":234,"text":"INTERACTION MODES\n\n1. Collaborative synthesis\n   (pair programming)\n\n2. Critique-repair ★ dominante\n   verificatore → propone fix\n   implementatore → applica\n\n3. Adversarial validation\n   fuzzer → crash-inducing input\n   (AutoSafeCoder)\n\n4. Reasoning debate\n   agenti argumentano,\n   majority vote decide","originalText":"INTERACTION MODES\n\n1. Collaborative synthesis\n   (pair programming)\n\n2. Critique-repair ★ dominante\n   verificatore → propone fix\n   implementatore → applica\n\n3. Adversarial validation\n   fuzzer → crash-inducing input\n   (AutoSafeCoder)\n\n4. Reasoning debate\n   agenti argumentano,\n   majority vote decide","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1B2631","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13013,"version":1,"versionNonce":13014,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

    {"type":"rectangle","id":"b3r3","x":708,"y":808,"width":300,"height":250,"strokeColor":"#DA702C","backgroundColor":"#FFFFFF","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13015,"version":1,"versionNonce":13016,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"roundness":{"type":3}},
    {"type":"text","id":"b3r3t","x":716,"y":816,"width":284,"height":234,"text":"TOPOLOGIE\n\nchain/waterfall — lineare (ChatDev)\ncyclic/agile — loop con feedback\nhierarchical — manager→workers\nstar — hub centrale\nadaptive — topologia ottimizzata\n\n⚠ Pattern osservato:\nComplessità topologia cresce\nquando manca un formal\nshared substrate.\nPiù il substrato è esplicito,\npiù semplice può essere\nla topologia.","originalText":"TOPOLOGIE\n\nchain/waterfall — lineare (ChatDev)\ncyclic/agile — loop con feedback\nhierarchical — manager→workers\nstar — hub centrale\nadaptive — topologia ottimizzata\n\n⚠ Pattern osservato:\nComplessità topologia cresce\nquando manca un formal\nshared substrate.\nPiù il substrato è esplicito,\npiù semplice può essere\nla topologia.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1B2631","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":13017,"version":1,"versionNonce":13018,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},

